   "author": "JustBacked",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/justbacked_new-grads-funded-startups-are-hiring-you-activity-7526295171668426753-D0ks",
   "text": "New grads: funded startups are hiring you too.\n\nRight now 156 venture-backed companies on JustBacked have 523 open new grad, junior and intern roles. 424 of them are internships.\n\nThe biggest early-career hirers: Alice & Bob, Commonwealth Fusion Systems, Fab2, Mach Industries and Axiom Solutions International (18 each), then Etched (15).\n\nSearch them at https://lnkd.in/gSERGG6b",
