   "author": "Etched Tech",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/etched-tech_the-etched-team-are-heading-to-slush-2026-activity-7526325811101196289-a0eD",
   "text": "The Etched team are heading to Slush 2026 in Helsinki next week! \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddee\n\nWe can\u2019t think of a better place to be than among founders and venture capitalists, discussing the importance of evidence capture and protecting your intellectual property as you build and grow a business.\n\nOur CEO, Ben Scott, CCO Robert Lee-Green and Chair, Robin Cave, will be joining our friends at CMS equIP for Start-ups throughout the event.\n\nIf you\u2019d like to hear more about what we\u2019re doing at Etched, we\u2019d love to hear from you. Get in touch at hello@etched.xyz\n\nSee you in Helsinki! \ud83d\ude80",
   "disc_score": 3,
