   "text": "20 AI INFERENCE CHIP COMPANIES YOU SHOULD KNOW \ud83d\udc40\n\nEveryone knows NVIDIA. I'm more interested in the semiconductor companies taking different approaches to running AI models.\n\nFrom memory-centric silicon and optical computing to tiny, always-on processors, there are some fascinating startups across Europe and the US.\n\nHere are 20 I\u2019m keeping an eye on \ud83d\udc47\n\n\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 Fractile - Developing memory-centric silicon to accelerate inference for large AI models.\n\n\ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddf1 Axelera AI - Building digital in-memory computing accelerators for edge and enterprise AI.\n\n\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 OLIX - Developing specialised chips and systems for large-scale AI inference.\n\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 d-Matrix - Building low-latency inference accelerators using digital i",
